  "contentHtml": "<P>\r\n<TABLE border=0 cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width=\"100%\">\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=30 width=100 align=center><IMG src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_title.gif\"></TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD colSpan=9 align=center>미국과학교육 현장</TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD bgColor=#e7e7e7 height=1 width=100 colSpan=11></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=30 width=100 align=center><IMG src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_name.gif\"></TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD align=center>김영학</TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD height=30 width=100 align=center><IMG src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_date.gif\"></TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD width=100 align=center>2011-03-01</TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>부산과학에 기고했던 <BR>미국과학교육현장 원고입니다.<BR><BR>읽어보시고 과학수업에 활용해보세요.<BR><BR>고맙습니다. </P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DAM6%26dataid%3D51%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20140119163605&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile255.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F22687F3D52DB803F332BAD')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_hwp_s.gif?rv=1.0.1\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> NSTA에 다녀와서.hwp</a></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>-------------------------</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DAM6%26dataid%3D51%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20140119163605&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile300.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F2538EC3652DB91D20228E1')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_hwp_s.gif?rv=1.0.1\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 미국과학교육현장(2011).hwp</a></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>------------------------------------------------------</P